::: {#eaf3fe74 .cell execution_count=41}
``` {.python .cell-code}
def replace_cousins(root):
    root.val = 0
    cur = [root]
    while cur:
        next_sum = 0
        for u in cur:
            if u.left:
                next_sum += u.left.val
            if u.right:
                next_sum += u.right.val
        nxt = []
        for u in cur:
            group = (u.left.val if u.left else 0) + (u.right.val if u.right else 0)
            for c in (u.left, u.right):
                if c:
                    c.val = next_sum - group
                    nxt.append(c)
        cur = nxt
    return root
```
